<h1>Bug Report — Contact API Endpoints</h1>

<table style="width: auto; border: none;">
<tr style="background: none;"><td style="border: none; font-weight: bold; width: 120px;">Date:</td><td style="border: none;">03 June 2026</td></tr>
<tr style="background: none;"><td style="border: none; font-weight: bold;">Project:</td><td style="border: none;">A* Classes Frontend</td></tr>
<tr style="background: none;"><td style="border: none; font-weight: bold;">Prepared for:</td><td style="border: none;">Backend Team</td></tr>
</table>

<hr style="border: 1px solid #1a56db; margin: 20px 0;">

<h2>Issue 1: Admin Contact Subjects (GET) — Missing Endpoint</h2>

<h3>Problem</h3>
<p><code>GET /api/admin/contact/subjects</code> returns <strong>HTTP 500</strong> with error:</p>
<code>"An unexpected error occurred: Request method 'GET' is not supported"</code>

<h3>Root Cause</h3>
<p>Backend only supports <code>POST /api/admin/contact/subjects</code> (for creating subjects). There is no GET endpoint to list subjects under the admin path.</p>

<h3>Fix Applied (Frontend)</h3>
<p>Changed <code>getAdminSubjects()</code> in <code>src/api/contactApi.ts</code> to use the public listing endpoint instead:</p>
<table>
<tr><th>Before</th><th>After</th></tr>
<tr><td><code>GET /api/admin/contact/subjects</code></td><td><code>GET /api/public/contact/subjects</code></td></tr>
</table>

<div class="note"><strong>Note:</strong> The public endpoint works and returns all subjects. Admin can still create/delete subjects via POST/DELETE.</div>

<h2>Issue 2: Admin Contact Subjects (POST) — Wrong URL Path</h2>

<h3>Problem</h3>
<p><code>POST /admin/api/contact/subjects</code> returns <strong>HTTP 500</strong> with error:</p>
<code>"An unexpected error occurred: No static resource admin/api/contact/subjects"</code>

<h3>Root Cause</h3>
<p>The correct backend path pattern for admin endpoints is <code>/api/admin/contact/...</code>, not <code>/admin/api/contact/...</code>.</p>

<h3>Fix Applied (Frontend)</h3>
<p>Reverted all admin paths in <code>src/api/contactApi.ts</code> from <code>/admin/api/contact/...</code> back to <code>/api/admin/contact/...</code>.</p>

<h3>All Admin Endpoints — Status</h3>
<table>
<tr><th>Function</th><th>Method</th><th>Path</th><th>Swagger Status</th></tr>
<tr><td><code>getAdminSubjects</code></td><td>GET</td><td><code>/api/public/contact/subjects</code></td><td><span class="badge-ok">Exists</span> (public)</td></tr>
<tr><td><code>createAdminSubject</code></td><td>POST</td><td><code>/api/admin/contact/subjects</code></td><td><span class="badge-ok">Exists</span></td></tr>
<tr><td><code>deleteAdminSubject</code></td><td>DELETE</td><td><code>/api/admin/contact/subjects/{id}</code></td><td><span class="badge-ok">Exists</span></td></tr>
<tr><td><code>getAdminMessages</code></td><td>GET</td><td><code>/api/admin/contact/messages</code></td><td><span class="badge-ok">Exists</span></td></tr>
<tr><td><code>updateAdminMessageStatus</code></td><td>PUT</td><td><code>/api/admin/contact/messages/{id}/status</code></td><td><span class="badge-ok">Exists</span></td></tr>
<tr><td><code>deleteAdminMessage</code></td><td>DELETE</td><td><code>/api/admin/contact/messages/{id}</code></td><td><span class="badge-ok">Exists</span></td></tr>
<tr style="background: #fee2e2;"><td><code>getAdminSettings</code></td><td>GET</td><td><code>/api/admin/contact/settings</code></td><td><span class="badge-missing">Not in Swagger</span></td></tr>
<tr style="background: #fee2e2;"><td><code>updateAdminSettings</code></td><td>PUT</td><td><code>/api/admin/contact/settings</code></td><td><span class="badge-missing">Not in Swagger</span></td></tr>
</table>

<h2>Issue 3: Contact Settings — Backend Endpoints Missing</h2>

<h3>Problem</h3>
<p>Both <code>GET /api/public/contact/settings</code> and <code>GET /api/admin/contact/settings</code> return <strong>HTTP 500</strong>.</p>

<h3>Root Cause</h3>
<p>The backend does not have contact settings endpoints at all. The Swagger specification shows settings only for Demo (boards/grades), not for Contact.</p>

<div class="info"><strong>No frontend fix possible.</strong> Backend team needs to implement these endpoints.</div>

<h3>Required Backend Endpoints</h3>
<table>
<tr><th>Method</th><th>Path</th><th>Purpose</th></tr>
<tr><td>GET</td><td><code>/api/admin/contact/settings</code></td><td>Admin — Get contact settings</td></tr>
<tr><td>PUT</td><td><code>/api/admin/contact/settings</code></td><td>Admin — Update contact settings</td></tr>
<tr><td>GET</td><td><code>/api/public/contact/settings</code></td><td>Public — Get contact settings</td></tr>
</table>

<hr style="border: 1px solid #ccc; margin: 20px 0;">

<h2>Swagger Reference</h2>
<p><strong>URL:</strong> <code>https://api.astarclasses.com/swagger-ui/index.html</code><br>
<strong>API Spec:</strong> <code>https://api.astarclasses.com/v3/api-docs</code></p>

<h3>Contact Endpoints Present in Swagger</h3>
<table>
<tr><th>#</th><th>Method</th><th>Path</th><th>Description</th></tr>
<tr><td>1</td><td>GET</td><td><code>/api/public/contact/subjects</code></td><td>List active subjects (public dropdown)</td></tr>
<tr><td>2</td><td>POST</td><td><code>/api/public/contact/message</code></td><td>Submit contact form (no OTP)</td></tr>
<tr><td>3</td><td>POST</td><td><code>/api/admin/contact/subjects</code></td><td>Create a new contact subject</td></tr>
<tr><td>4</td><td>DELETE</td><td><code>/api/admin/contact/subjects/{id}</code></td><td>Delete a contact subject</td></tr>
<tr><td>5</td><td>GET</td><td><code>/api/admin/contact/messages</code></td><td>View paginated/filtered messages</td></tr>
<tr><td>6</td><td>PUT</td><td><code>/api/admin/contact/messages/{id}/status</code></td><td>Update message status (READ/RESOLVED)</td></tr>
<tr><td>7</td><td>DELETE</td><td><code>/api/admin/contact/messages/{id}</code></td><td>Delete a message permanently</td></tr>
</table>

<hr style="border: 1px solid #ccc; margin: 20px 0;">

<h2>Recommendations for Backend Team</h2>
<ol>
<li><strong>Add <code>GET /api/admin/contact/subjects</code></strong> — So admin panel doesn't rely on public endpoint for subject listing</li>
<li><strong>Import all Contact Settings endpoints</strong> (GET/PUT admin, GET public) — Currently missing from backend entirely</li>
<li><strong>Old JS API (<code>src/api/api/contactApi.js</code>)</strong> still uses <code>/admin/api/contact/...</code> paths — These will also 500 if called. Should be updated to <code>/api/admin/contact/...</code></li>
</ol>

<hr style="border: 1px solid #1a56db; margin: 30px 0 10px 0;">

